---
Create a todo with substantive input content

Usage: telec-cli workflow todo create [OPTIONS] <SLUG> [CONTENT]

Arguments:
  <SLUG>     Todo slug (unique per project)
  [CONTENT]  Inline content for the required `input` artifact

Options:
      --project <PROJECT>          Override the project context. By default the project name is derived from the current working directory's basename
      --silent                     Emit the created event without requesting autonomous pickup
      --input-file <INPUT_FILE>    Path to a file whose contents seed the required `input` artifact
      --after <AFTER>              Dependency slugs. Repeat the flag or pass comma-separated values
      --kind <KIND>                Work item kind. Defaults to `feature` [default: feature]
      --description <DESCRIPTION>  Optional free-form description
      --group <GROUP>              Optional visual grouping label
  -h, --help                       Print help
